<Layout title="Our parish"><PageIntro title="A church to call home." label="Our parish" description="St. Peter the Apostle Antiochian Orthodox Church. Rooted in the ancient Christian faith, growing together in Southwest Florida."/><div class="wrap page-body"><div class="intro-two"><div class="prose"><h2>Faith, fellowship,<br/>and a warm welcome.</h2><p>We are Orthodox Christians, a community gathered around Jesus Christ and the faith handed down by His Apostles. Our parish is part of the Antiochian Orthodox Christian Archdiocese.</p><p>Our church family comes from across Southwest Florida, from Punta Gorda to Naples. We gather to worship, to share a meal, and to encourage one another in a life of faith.</p><p>Our mission from the beginning has been to offer an open and loving place to worship God, where people of every background can gather and love Him and each other.</p><a class="text-link" href="/what-we-are/">Learn what we believe <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div><img src="/assets/interior.webp" width="768" height="887" alt="Orthodox church iconography and candles"/></div><div class="info-grid"><a class="info-panel" href="/our-story/"><p class="eyebrow">Our beginnings</p><h3>A little room.<br/>A growing family.</h3><p>Our journey began in 2008. Discover the story of St. Peter.</p><span class="text-link">Read our story <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></span></a><a class="info-panel" href="/our-clergy/"><p class="eyebrow">Our pastor</p><h3>Meet Father<br/>Hans Jacobse.</h3><p>A spiritual father shepherding the parish since its beginning.</p><span class="text-link">Meet our clergy <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></span></a><a class="info-panel" href="/visit/"><p class="eyebrow">Our invitation</p><h3>Your next step<br/>can be simple.</h3><p>Come worship with us. We would love to meet you.</p><span class="text-link">Plan your visit <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></span></a></div></div></Layout>
